│  Agent: Head Caterer                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                       │
│  Final Answer:                                                                                        │
│  As the Head Caterer, I have carefully reviewed the dietary requirements and seating constraints for  │
│  all guests. To ensure a safe, inclusive, and conflict-free dining experience, I have designed a      │
│  menu that accommodates the specific needs of Alice (Vegetarian), Bob (Carnivore), Charlie            │
│  (Gluten-Free), David (No restrictions), Eve (Vegan), and Fiona (Pescatarian).                        │
│                                                                                                       │
│  ### The Unified Catering Menu                                                                        │
│                                                                                                       │
│  To prevent cross-contamination while honoring individual health and ethical requirements, all        │
│  dishes will be prepared in dedicated prep zones.                                                     │
│                                                                                                       │
│  **Appetizer: The Harvest Selection**                                                                 │
│  *   **For Eve (Vegan) & Alice (Vegetarian):** Roasted Cauliflower and Chickpea Salad with a          │
│  Lemon-Tahini dressing (Gluten-Free).                                                                 │
│  *   **For Charlie (Gluten-Free/Vegetarian):** Grilled Artichoke Hearts with Balsamic Reduction       │
│  (Gluten-Free).                                                                                       │
│  *   **For Fiona (Pescatarian):** Smoked Salmon Blinis (using gluten-free buckwheat flour to          │
│  accommodate Charlie).                                                                                │
│  *   **For Bob & David (Carnivore/No Restrictions):** Prosciutto-wrapped Melon.                       │
│                                                                                                       │
│  **Main Course Options:**                                                                             │
│  *   **The Vegan/Vegetarian Choice:** Quinoa-Stuffed Bell Peppers with Roasted Root Vegetables,       │
│  Herbs, and Pine Nuts (Gluten-Free, Vegan, Dairy-Free, Meat-Free).                                    │
│  *   **The Pescatarian Choice:** Pan-Seared Wild Cod with a Quinoa-Herb Crust, Wilted Spinach, and    │
│  Lemon (Gluten-Free, contains fish).                                                                  │
│  *   **The Carnivore Choice:** Prime Rib-Eye Steak with a side of Bacon-wrapped Scallops (Strictly    │
│  animal-sourced, no plant-based additives, Gluten-Free). *Note: Prepared in a separate pan to ensure  │
│  no contact with vegetables/grains.*                                                                  │
│                                                                                                       │
│  **Dessert:**                                                                                         │
│  *   **For All:** Flourless Dark Chocolate Torte made with coconut cream instead of dairy. This dish  │
│  is naturally gluten-free, vegan, vegetarian, and contains no fish or meat, ensuring safety for all   │
│  dietary profiles.                                                                                    │
│                                                                                                       │
│  ***                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                       │
│  ### Seating Plan Strategy                                                                            │
│  To honor the complex social requirements, I have organized the event into two distinct "Zones" to    │
│  manage the distance between Bob and the others:                                                      │
│                                                                                                       │
│  **Table A (The "Plant-Forward" Table):**                                                             │
│  *   **Window Seat:** **Eve** (Accommodates her request for a window and distance from Bob).          │
│  *   **Adjacent to Eve:** **Alice** (Seated away from Bob and Charlie).                               │
│  *   **Adjacent to Alice:** **Fiona** (Fulfills her requirement to be next to Alice).                 │
│  *   *Note: Charlie has been placed at a separate table to honor Alice's request to be seated away    │
│  from him.*                                                                                           │
│                                                                                                       │
│  **Table B (The "Main Course" Table):**                                                               │
│  *   **Seat 1:** **Bob** (Maintains distance from Eve and Alice).                                     │
│  *   **Seat 2:** **David** (Ensures he is next to Bob as requested).                                  │
│  *   **Seat 3:** **Charlie** (Ensures he is seated at a safe distance from Alice).                    │
│                                                                                                       │
│  This arrangement ensures that no guest's dietary or interpersonal requirements are compromised,      │
